#: scenario9:scenario9_F197EFDC_7DCD_43E4_A35E_B6655CB7E1DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b1d19909b3c7efc0a4ef0bb1f4ee45a0e1515a8b649b18b1cec7751a688028f
