msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what I thought...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But look at her hair—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that flaxen color...⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫It’s almost the exact same color as mine."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ quello che ho pensato anch’io...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Però, guarda i suoi capelli—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"quel colore dorato...⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫È⟪k:10⟫ quasi lo stesso identico colore dei miei."

#: scenario9:scenario9_3C87ED4F_C7C8_4247_AC21_2EFF4875E378
